cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this code, please cite the paper.
title: "What RL Brings to Reasoning: A Few Decisions the Base Model Would Not Make"
abstract: >-
  Reinforcement learning substantially improves base language models on hard
  math problems, but what it adds to the base model remains unclear. We test
  common explanations of this gain with a sequence of diagnostic interventions
  on the base model of an RL-trained Qwen3-4B pair, using 120 AIME problems.
